,"msg_0138_D49R0101_00037":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00038":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00039":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00040":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00041":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00042":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00043":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00044":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00045":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00046":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00047":"","msg_0138_D49R0101_00048":"Hello. Oh, you must be new here.\\nWelcome to the Athlete Shop!\\rHave you and your Pokémon\\nbeen exercising?\\rFlying sweat!\\nBreathing in unison!\\fNewborn friendship!\\rWe support your Pokéathlete lifestyle.\\nThe Athlete Points you have earned\\fcan be used here for prizes.\\rLet me say this again.\\nWelcome to the Athlete Shop! {YESNO 0}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00049":"Welcome to the Athlete Shop! {YESNO 0}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00050":"We are closed for the day.\\nPlease come back tomorrow for\\fa whole new set of prizes!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00051":"Thank you, please come again.","msg_0138_D49R0101_00052":"The scores in the Pokéathlon...\\nThe proof of your friendship with your\\fPokémon, so to speak, give you\\fAthlete Points.\\rYou can trade them here for\\nvarious prizes.\\rScore as much as possible and come back\\nhere for prizes!\\rIs there anything else I can do\\nfor you? {YESNO 0}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00053":"Welcome!\\rThis is the place we keep the Pokéathlon\\ndatabase.\\rUsing the Data Card at the monitor\\nnext to me will allow you to check your\\frecords.\\rSome are cool, and some are...\\nembarrassing!\\rPlease make good use of it.\\rWould you like to buy a Data Card\\nthat contains Pokéathlon\\frecords? {YESNO 0}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00054":"Welcome!\\rThe Data Card, which contains\\nPokéathlon records, is sold here.\\rWould you like to buy a Data Card? {YESNO 0}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00055":"Giggle!\\nThe truth is, I know a lot about you!\\fLet me see...\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00056":"You’ve participated in\\nthe Pokéathlon...\\f{STRVAR_1 51, 0, 0} times!\\fGiggle!\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00057":"You’ve participated in\\nthe Pokéathlon...\\fWow, over 100 times!\\rBravo!\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00058":"As I just demonstrated, the Pokéathlon\\ndatabase seems to know everything.\\fDoesn’t that interest you?\\rYou can exchange your Athlete Points\\nfor a Data Card and check your\\frecords using the monitor next to me.\\rPlease make good use of it.\\nIs there anything else I can\\fdo for you? {YESNO 0}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00059":"Thank you. Please come again!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00060":"Hello, Pokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\rAre you working on breaking your own\\nrecords? You can check your records\\fat the monitor next to me.\\rCheck it out from time to time!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00061":"We have run out of Data Cards.\\nBut don’t be disappointed.\\rThere are more Data Cards to come!\\nI will make sure to get them for you.\\fPlease come back later.","msg_0138_D49R0101_00062":"We have run out of Data Cards.\\nBut don’t be disappointed.\\rThere are more Data Cards to come...\\nOr not!\\rYou have collected all the Data Cards!\\nWonderful!\\rYou are a true Pokéathlete,\\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\rPlease continue to work on breaking\\nyour own records!\\rThank you for coming!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00063":"So they have ten events?\\n...Which Pokémon should I choose?","msg_0138_D49R0101_00064":"There are five Pokéathlon courses!\\rThey are divided into Speed, Power,\\nStamina, Jump, and Skill.\\rYou have to choose your Pokémon\\ncarefully according to the course.","msg_0138_D49R0101_00065":"Some Pokémon are good at Speed events.\\nSome are not. You need to form a team\\fwhose members can help one another.","msg_0138_D49R0101_00066":"If you go on, you’ll see the\\nMuseum of Pokéathlete Records.\\rI will someday be a Pokéathlete holding\\na record there!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00067":"The score you achieve in the Pokéathlon\\nwill become Athlete Points, and you can\\fexchange them for prizes.\\rYou may be the last team to finish, but\\nyour score will still count!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00068":"“Hurdle Dash”\\rMany Hurdles await your Pokémon!\\nBe faster and more precise than\\feveryone else! Jump over the Hurdles\\fand aim for number one!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00069":"“Pennant Capture”\\rPennants are hidden on the beach.\\nFight over them and come back with as\\fmany Pennants as you can!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00070":"“Circle Push”\\rThe time has come to show off your\\nPokémon’s Power!\\fPush them away and stay in the Circle!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00071":"“Block Smash”\\rA mountain of Blocks awaits\\nyour Pokémon!\\fUse its Power to smash them all!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00072":"“Disc Catch”\\rDiscs are thrown at you. Jump and\\ncatch them in the air!\\rDon’t get cornered by others.\\nCatch as many as you can!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00073":"“Lamp Jump”\\rYou never know how high you’re going\\nto bounce! Use your Pokémon’s Jump\\fand Skill to score!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00074":"“Relay Run”\\rKeep running until you can’t run\\nany more! Three Pokémon work together\\fto achieve victory!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00075":"“Ring Drop”\\rPokémon tackle! Go beyond your Stamina\\nlimit and stay in the Ring!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00076":"“Snow Throw”\\rOn an incredibly cold playfield,\\nmillions of balls of Snow await!\\rAim and throw!\\nTime it right to show your skill!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00077":"“Goal Roll”\\rPut your heart into hitting the ball!\\nAttack! Defend your Goal!\\rAim for the other Goals!\\nWho gets the victory?","msg_0138_D49R0101_00078":"Work with your Pokémon. Believe in them,\\nand help them believe in you! Believe in\\ftheir potential. Let the friendship lead\\fyour team to victory!\\rThe Pokéathlon is always with you!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00079":"Charge your energy with friendship!\\nGive Aprijuice to your Pokémon!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00080":"Whitney: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Are you here\\nfor the Pokéathlon? Me, too!\\rI have been so excited since its\\nconstruction. It is close to Goldenrod\\fCity, you know?\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00081":"Huh?\\rWere you going to participate in\\nthe Pokéathlon looking like that?\\rYou’re not prepared at all, are you?\\rSo...\\nAre you a medium or a small?\\fYou look more like a medium...\\rOK!\\nI’ll get you a jersey that suits you!\\rYou want to look your best if you’re\\ngoing to participate in the Pokéathlon,\\fdon’t you?\\rWait right there!\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00082":"This is just right for you!\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00083":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a jersey!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00084":"You look perfect.\\nNow that you are ready, I will...\\rOh, no!\\nWhere are my Pokémon?\\rI have to go back.\\nSee ya!\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00085":"The vending machine is for participants!\\nYou can even use your\\fAthlete Points. {YESNO 0}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00086":"Which drink would you like? {YESNO 0}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00087":"Clang!\\rA can of {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} dropped down.\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00088":"Clang!\\rBonus! Another can of {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0}\\ndropped down.\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00089":"Not enough money...","msg_0138_D49R0101_00090":"Not enough points...","msg_0138_D49R0101_00091":"Decided not to buy a drink.","msg_0138_D49R0101_00092":"Opening the Pokéathlon Data...\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00093":"Which data would you like to see? {YESNO 0}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00094":"OVERALL DATA {ALN_CENTER}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00095":"EVENT DATA {ALN_CENTER}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00096":"ACTION DATA {ALN_CENTER}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00097":"EXIT {ALN_CENTER}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00098":"Accessing......","msg_0138_D49R0101_00099":"Accessing............","msg_0138_D49R0101_00100":"Accessing..................","msg_0138_D49R0101_00101":"Thank you for accessing!","msg_0138_D49R0101_00102":"Welcome to the Museum Shop!\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00103":"Wow, you have such good eyes! Can\\nI tell you about my last dream? {YESNO 0}","msg_0138_D49R0101_00104":"Hmmm... My discerning eyes must have\\nbecome weak...","msg_0138_D49R0101_00105":"I used to love Jump events.\\rThe record I have from when I was fully\\nactive as a Pokéathlete is 998 jumps!\\rJust two more!\\nAll I had to make was two more!\\rI had to retire due to my age...\\nCould I ask you to jump 1,000 times\\ffor me?\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00106":"Well, the record may make you dizzy.\\nBut you’re still young.\\fYou can do it!\\rI’ll just sit and wait.","msg_0138_D49R0101_00107":"Oh! You!\\nIt is so wonderful of you!\\fYou have jumped 1,000 times.\\rThank you so much!\\nThis is just a token of my appreciation.\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00108":"I’m now your fan. I’m old as you see,\\nbut I will support you no matter what.","msg_0138_D49R0101_00109":"You know what?\\nI have tackled over 500 times finally!\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00110":"Haha!\\nYou’re doing fine, but not as good\\fas me. I wonder if any Pokéathlete\\fcould be better at tackling than me.\\fSigh...","msg_0138_D49R0101_00111":"You know what?\\nI have tackled over 1,000 times!\\fFinally!\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00112":"You know what? I’ve finally tackled\\nover 2,000 times! I bet no one can\\fbreak this record easily!\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00113":"......!\\nNo! That’s not right!\\fYour record beats mine?\\rNooooo!\\n...OK. You win.\\rI admit complete defeat.\\nPlease take this.\\r","msg_0138_D49R0101_00114":"Whew!\\nIt’s strange, but I feel great.\\rI do regret that I lost, but it made\\nme know where I am.\\rI understand that there are many\\nPokéathletes better than me.\\rThis is where I begin to grow again!\\nKeep up the good work!"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_023 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_009":9,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_010":10,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_011":11,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_012":12,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R0101_013":13,"_EV_scr_seq_D49R010